msgstr "Unganisha faili zote za JS za ndani ziwe faili moja."

#: tpl/page_optm/settings_js.tpl.php:51
#: tpl/page_optm/settings_js.tpl.php:85
msgid "This option may result in a JS error or layout issue on frontend pages with certain themes/plugins."
msgstr "Chaguo hizi zinaweza kusababisha hitilafu ya JS au tatizo la mpangilio kwenye kurasa za mbele kwa mandhari/programu-jalizi fulani."

#: tpl/page_optm/settings_js.tpl.php:52
msgid "JS error can be found from the developer console of browser by right clicking and choosing Inspect."
msgstr "Hitilafu ya JS inaweza kupatikana kwenye dashibodi ya msanidi programu ya kivinjari kwa kubofya kulia na kuchagua Kagua."

#: tpl/page_optm/settings_js.tpl.php:66
#, php-format
msgid "Include external JS and inline JS in combined file when %1$s is also enabled. This option helps maintain the priorities of JS execution, which should minimize potential errors caused by JS Combine."
msgstr "Jumuisha JS ya nje na JS ya ndani kwenye faili iliyounganishwa wakati %1$s imewezeshwa pia. Chaguo hili hususan linasaidia kudumisha vipaumbele vya utekelezaji wa JS, jambo ambalo linapaswa kupunguza makosa yanayoweza kusababishwa na Kuunganishwa kwa JS."

#: tpl/page_optm/settings_js.tpl.php:77
msgid "Deferred"
msgstr "Imeakhirishwa"

#: tpl/page_optm/settings_js.tpl.php:77
msgid "Delayed"
msgstr "Imerejeshwa nyuma"

#: tpl/page_optm/settings_js.tpl.php:79
msgid "Deferring until page is parsed or delaying till interaction can help reduce resource contention and improve performance causing a lower FID (Core Web Vitals metric)."
msgstr "Kuahirisha hadi ukurasa utekelezwe au kuchelewesha hadi mwingiliano kuwezekane kunaweza kusaidia kupunguza ushindani wa rasilimali na kuboresha utendaji na kusababisha FID ya chini (kipimo cha Core Web Vitals)."

