#, php-format
msgid "If set to %s this is done in the foreground, which may slow down page load."
msgstr "Ikiwa imewekwa kuwa %s hii inafanywa kwa mbele, jambo ambalo linaweza kupunguza kasi ya upakiaji wa ukurasa."

#: tpl/page_optm/settings_media.tpl.php:200
