msgid "Load iframes only when they enter the viewport."
msgstr "Pakia iframe tu wakati zinaingia kwenye eneo la kuona."

#: tpl/page_optm/settings_media.tpl.php:248
msgid "Set an explicit width and height on image elements to reduce layout shifts and improve CLS (a Core Web Vitals metric)."
msgstr "Weka upana na urefu ulio wazi kwenye vipengele vya picha ili kupunguza mabadiliko ya mpangilio na kuboresha CLS (kipimo cha Core Web Vitals)."

